WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.779 --> 00:00:04.661
What do you say?

00:00:06.836 --> 00:00:08.392
I want you to be my VP.

00:00:08.695 --> 00:00:10.661
I want you, you're my Vice.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:12.649
Well, George, I uh...

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:17.667
I'm a CEO of a large company.

00:00:18.942 --> 00:00:21.666
And I have been Secretary of Defense.

00:00:21.876 --> 00:00:24.876
And I have been White House Chief of Staff.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:29.357
The Vice Presidency is a mostly symbolic job.

00:00:29.756 --> 00:00:30.392
Uh huh.

00:00:30.553 --> 00:00:33.553
However, if we came to a uh...

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:36.854
different...

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.124
understanding...

00:00:38.124 --> 00:00:42.420
And I can handle the more mundane...jobs.

00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:45.310
Overseeing bureaucracy,

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.907
military,

00:00:46.952 --> 00:00:47.861
energy,

00:00:48.306 --> 00:00:48.904
and um,

00:00:49.142 --> 00:00:51.103
foreign policy.

00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:53.876
Yeah, right.

00:00:53.877 --> 00:00:54.733
I like that.

00:01:03.407 --> 00:01:06.298
When you have power, people will always try to take it from you.

00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:07.012
Always.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.193
Are you even more ruthless than you used to be?

00:01:36.287 --> 00:01:39.180
So we gonna do this thing, or what? I mean, is this happening?

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.516
I believe...

00:01:42.181 --> 00:01:43.842
we can make this work.

00:01:43.842 --> 00:01:45.657
[laughing] hot damn.

